<div class="config-editor-body">
  <p class="hint">
    Ligue ou desligue cada bloco do sistema conforme a campanha deste mundo.
    <strong>Desligar nunca apaga nada</strong> — o bloco só some da interface e para de aceitar
    conteúdo novo; Atores, Itens e Compêndios que já existem continuam intactos, e religar
    devolve tudo como estava.
  </p>

  <div class="feature-presets">
    <p class="block-title">Presets de Campanha</p>
    <div class="feature-preset-row">
      {{#each presets as |preset|}}
      <button type="button" class="feature-preset-btn" data-action="applyPreset" data-preset="{{preset.key}}" title="{{preset.hint}}">
        {{preset.label}}
      </button>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-list">
    {{#each features as |feature|}}
    <div class="feature-row {{#unless feature.checked}}is-off{{/unless}}">
      <label class="feature-main">
        <input type="checkbox" data-feature="{{feature.key}}" {{#if feature.checked}}checked{{/if}}/>
        <span class="feature-text">
          <span class="feature-name">{{feature.name}}</span>
          <span class="feature-hint">{{feature.hint}}</span>
        </span>
      </label>

      {{#if feature.children.length}}
      <div class="feature-children">
        {{#each feature.children as |child|}}
        <label class="feature-main child {{#unless ../feature.checked}}is-inherited-off{{/unless}}">
          <input type="checkbox" data-feature="{{child.key}}" {{#if child.checked}}checked{{/if}}/>
          <span class="feature-text">
            <span class="feature-name">{{child.name}}</span>
            <span class="feature-hint">{{child.hint}}</span>
          </span>
        </label>
        {{/each}}
      </div>
      {{/if}}
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </div>

  <footer class="sheet-footer">
    <button type="button" data-action="save"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Salvar</button>
  </footer>
</div>
